  "Overview": "From Dust is the latest original game concept by Eric Chahi, creator of the cult classic, Another World. \n\nImmerse yourself in a world as exotically beautiful as it is dangerous! You control the destiny of a primitive tribe against the backdrop of a world in constant evolution - a universe where mighty Nature reclaims what is hers; and your mastery of the elements is your people's only chance of survival...",
